  "D(k) = Schonheim - [k = 5 mod 6] is used only as an upper bound, proved by PROOF.PACKING_UPPER_BOUND (no external theorem). The correction is load-bearing: see SCHONHEIM_ONLY_PRUNED.",
  "R5 L_single/L_pair are reused verbatim (r5.n1_bound); R4 R(a) via r4.quad_table; R3 kmax prefix caps, packing bound, identity, constants and S3 formula via the pinned r3 module."
